{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790386630956,"sessionID":"ses_f24a5f915ffe0dMiHLlPu2Vj6X","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_8igACQLx5liaYANnXya8yk8S","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/task_config.json"},"output":"<path>/workspace/task_config.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"instruction\": \"Implement the CRT screen shader in screen_effect/screen_effect.gdshader. Use a canvas_item shader with render_mode unshaded and skip_vertex_transform. Add constants for curvature (7.0) and vignette_multiplier (2.0), and declare a sampler2D uniform named screen_texture with the screen texture hint and linear mipmap filtering. In fragment(), compute centered UVs from SCREEN_UV, warp the UVs for curvature, apply a cutoff mask outside the screen, add scanlines, add a vignette, and sample the screen texture with a small LOD bias to blur. Output the final color with alpha 1.0.\"\n3: }\n\n(End of file - total 3 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the CRT screen shader in screen_effect/screen_effect.gdshader. Use a canvas_item shader with render_mode unshaded and skip_vertex_transform. Add constants for curvature (7.0) and vignette_multiplier (2.0), and declare a sampler2D uniform named screen_texture with the screen texture hint and linear mipmap filtering. In fragment(), compute centered UVs from SCREEN_UV, warp the UVs for curvature, apply a cutoff mask outside the screen, add scanlines, add a vignette, and sample the screen texture with a small LOD bias to blur. Output the final color with alpha 1.0.\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/task_config.json","text":"{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the CRT screen shader in screen_effect/screen_effect.gdshader. Use a canvas_item shader with render_mode unshaded and skip_vertex_transform. Add constants for curvature (7.0) and vignette_multiplier (2.0), and declare a sampler2D uniform named